@startuml
title SC-102 · 开启或结束本人 WebRTC 电话服务
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #55657D
skinparam ArrowFontColor #344054
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #8291A8
  FontColor #25324A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E8
  DiamondBorderColor #D19724
  DiamondFontColor #754B00
  BackgroundColor<<event>> #F4EDFF
  BorderColor<<event>> #8A5AC2
  FontColor<<event>> #5D348D
  BackgroundColor<<start_label>> #EEF2FF
  BorderColor<<start_label>> #315EFB
  BackgroundColor<<end_label>> #F2F4F7
  BorderColor<<end_label>> #667085
  BackgroundColor<<failure>> #FFF0F3
  BorderColor<<failure>> #C9364F
  FontColor<<failure>> #8F1930
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #BAC5D5
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #E9EDF3
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontColor #344054
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontSize 13
!pragma useVerticalIf on
|#EDF4FF|lane_1| 关联坐席的中台用户
|#EFFAF5|lane_2| 统一外呼中台
|#FFF8E8|lane_3| AliCti
|lane_1|
start
:开始或结束当前租户的人工外呼工作; <<start_label>>
|lane_1|
:进入当前租户坐席工作台或呼叫弹窗\n输出：本人电话服务入口;
|lane_2|
:校验本人坐席、技能、号码及 HTTPS/麦克风许可\n输出：有效身份、授权资源与设备条件;
|lane_2|
if (本人身份、麦克风与会话占用检查均通过？) then (不满足 · ALT-102-3)
|lane_1|
:提示缺项或拒绝第二入口，不强制抢占; <<failure>>
stop
else (满足)
|lane_2|
:初始化电话组件、注册事件并取得本人短期登录材料\nsetup回调后注册事件；后端校验绑定后申请sessionKey;
|lane_3|
:处理本人坐席登录及软电话媒体连接\n返回登录结果和实际状态;
|lane_2|
if (登录与软电话就绪均已确认？) then (已就绪)
|lane_1|
:电话就绪后处理业务；无在途和未保存结果时申请下线\n拨号/接听/挂断沿用原操作权限;
|lane_2|
if (通话结束且结果已保存，并允许完全退出？) then (不满足 · ALT-102-6)
|lane_1|
:保留会话和结果输入；核对状态，不提前释放; <<failure>>
stop
else (满足)
|lane_2|
:确认完全下线成功后释放本地会话与锁\nlogoutMode=1；退出失败不伪造离线;
|lane_1|
:本次操作结束：结果已展示并可追溯; <<end_label>>
stop
endif
else (失败或待确认 · ALT-102-REGISTER)
|lane_1|
:保留不可呼叫状态；提示鉴权/麦克风/占用/网络问题，不伪报上线; <<failure>>
stop
endif
endif
@enduml
